00:05:49.149 --> 00:05:50.469
Um...


00:05:50.629 --> 00:05:52.637
Can you take me
off speaker, please?


00:05:52.789 --> 00:05:54.230
Sorry, sweetie,
I'd have to disconnect you


00:05:54.389 --> 00:05:56.353
