it's a very complex system.


00:05:56.509 --> 00:05:57.513
OK.


00:05:58.908 --> 00:06:01.757
Look, you're not
gonna like this, but...


00:06:01.908 --> 00:06:03.992
Ethan and I
are getting married.


00:06:04.148 --> 00:06:07.269
He proposed two weeks ago
