00:06:12.668 --> 00:06:16.072
- He proposed on his birthday?
- I don't understand.


00:06:16.228 --> 00:06:17.995
I'm in love with him.


00:06:18.988 --> 00:06:20.996
That's really great,
sweetie, but...


00:06:21.147 --> 00:06:23.188
You're only 24 years old.


00:06:23.347 --> 00:06:25.191
Nobody gets married
at 24 anymore.


00:06:25.347 --> 00:06:27.191
