with zero future.


00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:43.034
OK. I have an idea.


00:06:43.186 --> 00:06:47.234
If you think he's such a loser,
then don't come to the wedding!


00:06:51.665 --> 00:06:53.345
Jesus, turn that thing down!


00:06:55.705 --> 00:07:00.146
Down volume!
Down volume!


00:07:00.305 --> 00:07:03.545
