00:07:53.542 --> 00:07:55.702
David and I know
where we stand with each other.


00:07:55.861 --> 00:07:58.229
That's how we've lasted this long.
Somehow, it works.


00:07:58.382 --> 00:08:01.906
Well, don't look at me.
