Boy, it's, um...


00:08:37.539 --> 00:08:39.066
Well...
Really not very good, is it?


00:08:39.219 --> 00:08:41.063
-It's not good at all. No.
- No.


00:08:46.659 --> 00:08:48.142
What's up
