I hear Nina travelled
around Europe for a while


01:20:35.722 --> 01:20:38.962
and eventually got a job
at a fancy restaurant in Rome.


01:20:39.121 --> 01:20:43.082
This year, her parents are going to
visit her for Thanksgiving.


01:20:49.200 --> 01:20:50.848
I'm not saying
what happened last Christmas


01:20:51.000 --> 01:20:53.084
happened solely
because of Nina.


01:20:54.440 --> 01:20:57.888
I'm saying maybe what happened
needed to happen,


01:20:58.040 --> 01:21:00.364
even for me.


01:21:02.920 --> 01:21:04.644
- Ah!
- Whoa! Whoa!


01:21:04.800 --> 01:21:06.687
My dad came into the city
the other day


01:21:06.840 --> 01:21:08.640
to celebrate my new job.


01:21:09.799 --> 01:21:12.320
He told me he offered the house
to my mom but...


01:21:12.480 --> 01:21:13.963
...she didn't want it.


01:21:14.120 --> 01:21:17.840
He thought about selling
but decided to hold onto it


01:21:17.999 --> 01:21:19.482
for when Toby and I
come visit.


01:21:19.639 --> 01:21:22.279
He's still
figuring things out.


01:21:22.439 --> 01:21:25.886
But, luckily, he has
his best friend to help with that.


01:22:46.354 --> 01:22:49.801
# I saw you, I found you


01:22:49.954 --> 01:22:53.281
# I watched you grow


01:22:53.433 --> 01:22:56.281
# Slowly but surely


01:22:56.434 --> 01:23:00.514
# We ebb and we ﬂow


01:23:00.673 --> 01:23:04.001
# I felt a change


01:23:04.152 --> 01:23:07.557
# Deep in my bones


01:23:07.712 --> 01:23:12.437
# Something new


01:23:12.592 --> 01:23:14.633
# Has grown


01:23:20.232 --> 01:23:23.559
# I was inside waiting


01:23:23.712 --> 01:23:27.159
# Eyes open wide


01:23:27.311 --> 01:23:32.996
# I felt the ground beneath me wake


01:23:34.431 --> 01:23:37.836
# I felt a change


01:23:37.991 --> 01:23:41.439
# Deep in my bones


01:23:41.590 --> 01:23:47.155
# Something new


01:23:47.311 --> 01:23:49.394
# Has grown


01:24:02.829 --> 01:24:05.349
# Up in your room


01:24:05.509 --> 01:24:09.874
# Was a great silent storm


01:24:10.029 --> 01:24:11.273
# Clouds have cleared


01:24:11.429 --> 01:24:15.913
# The air was sweet and warm. #

